  n<//  Synthesizable L1 Unified Data and Instruction Cache         //> u<10> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10027> s<11> l<9:1> el<9:67>
  n<//  Cache is 4-way, 256 line and 16 bytes per line for          //> u<11> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10027> s<12> l<10:1> el<10:67>
  n<//  a total of 16KB. The cache policy is write-through and      //> u<12> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10027> s<13> l<11:1> el<11:67>
  n<//  read allocate. For swap instructions (SWP and SWPB) the     //> u<13> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10027> s<14> l<12:1> el<12:67>
  n<//  location is evicted from the cache and read from main       //> u<14> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10027> s<15> l<13:1> el<13:67>
  n<//  memory.                                                     //> u<15> t<LINE_COMMENT> p<10027> s<16> l<14:1> el<14:67>
